Part of #434. This is an owner action.

The last Pages deployment ran on 2026-10-23 from `9b7b4ab9` (before #433). The public site therefore does not yet show:

- day-precise release dates;
- edition rules, printed denominators and the standard card size for every item;
- the SM05 jumbo evidence;
- the Kisstick, SM05 and HK/TW owner decisions;
- the joined duplicate specimens.

## To do

- [ ] Wait until the work that should ship together has merged.
- [ ] Run the manual `Publish site` workflow (`workflow_dispatch`). It is gated by `verification/publication_gate.py` and the approvals in `publication-decisions.json`.
- [ ] Check the deployed page.

Publishing is the one step in this project that cannot be undone, so it stays a deliberate owner action.
